  "solution": "Given equation: 75 ÷ 8 × 6 + 24 - 6 = 31.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) **÷ and -**\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 8 × 6 + 24 - 6 = 31.\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 75 - 8 × 6 + __**24 ÷ 6**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 75 - __**8 × 6**__ + 4 = 31\n\n⇒ __**75**__ - 48 __**+ 4**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __79 - 48__ = 31\n\n⇒ 31 = 31\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) - and +\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 8 × 6 + 24 - 6 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**75 ÷ 8**__ × 6 - 24 + 6 = 31\n\n⇒ __**9.375 **____**× 6**__ - 24 + 6 = 31\n\n⇒ __**56.25**__ - 24 __**+ 6**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __62.25____ - 24__ = 31\n\n⇒ 38.25 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and -\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 8 × 6 + 24 - 6 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**75 ÷ 8**__ - 6 + 24 × 6 = 31\n\n⇒ 9.375 - 6 + __**24 **____**×**____** 6**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __**9.375**__ - 6 __**+ **144__ = 31\n\n⇒ __153.375 - 6__ = 31\n\n⇒ 147.375 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 8 × 6 + 24 - 6 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 75 + 8 × __**6 ÷ 24**__ - 6 = 31\n\n⇒ 75 + __**8 × 0.25**__ - 6 = 31\n\n⇒ __**75 + 2**__ - 6 = 31\n\n⇒ __77 -____ 6__ = 31\n\n⇒ 71 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
